    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/d812798394efa67e763aacb9ab9c3780.poster.avif?t=1738764390\" width=610 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/d812798394efa67e763aacb9ab9c3780.webm?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/d812798394efa67e763aacb9ab9c3780.mp4?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br><br>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Urbex Murder</strong> is a horror game centered on exploring abandoned places (Urbex), playable <strong>solo or in co-op</strong> with up to 4 players and featuring integrated voice chat. It offers several immersive game modes and maps. For example, in co-op mode, players must find a hidden object, but the one who discovers it becomes a secret enemy tasked with preventing the others from escaping. Players need to solve puzzles, identify the enemy, and rescue captured teammates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/29f78a73fc2427eaa0c146bce085eb2b.avif?t=1738764390\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Abandoned Places</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the best <strong>Urbex</strong> adventure in this game. Exploring abandoned places is essential to discovering important information on the selected map, allowing you to progress and gain an advantage over other players based on the chosen game mode. Nothing is random; every detail matters. Find the generators to reduce the visibility of others, collect missing parts to drive a vehicle, move objects, or create your own traps to imprison an opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/8ccbce0d70a8f33a88a21e2b49a4370a.poster.avif?t=1738764390\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/8ccbce0d70a8f33a88a21e2b49a4370a.webm?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/8ccbce0d70a8f33a88a21e2b49a4370a.mp4?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress Through the Adventure with Your Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>co-op</strong> mode, you will have the opportunity to play different game modes available in the game and experience Urbex with friends. Choose the map, the game mode, and invite your friends using the invitation system directly integrated into <strong>Urbex Murder</strong>. The in-game <strong>voice chat</strong> will provide a better immersion, allowing you to speak only with nearby players and find a walkie-talkie on the map to give to a player of your choice for distant communication.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/ebdba24fe006b7d2e6644602037ac3bc.poster.avif?t=1738764390\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/ebdba24fe006b7d2e6644602037ac3bc.webm?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/ebdba24fe006b7d2e6644602037ac3bc.mp4?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Maps, Unique Scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple maps</strong> available do not just mean a visual change. Each map has its own unique story and different mechanics that will be integrated. Each location on the map will affect the difficulty of progression. Depending on the selected map, you will encounter unexpected strangers. Replaying the same map will give you a different experience with random events.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/f5290cf1f3b45899711a640b47e1871a.poster.avif?t=1738764390\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/f5290cf1f3b45899711a640b47e1871a.webm?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/f5290cf1f3b45899711a640b47e1871a.mp4?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles and Rescue Your Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a successful <strong>Urbex experience</strong>, you will have the ability to influence the progress of other players through game mechanics. Prevent your opponents from entering certain areas to waste their time. Set traps, immobilize a player in a location of your choice, and increase the difficulty for their teammates to find them. Barricade all exits, cut the power to more easily detect the location of opponents with their flashlights on. This is just a preview of the available mechanics, and there are many more to discover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/915c8b7bac2410695545cb94d0493b73.poster.avif?t=1738764390\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/915c8b7bac2410695545cb94d0493b73.webm?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282980/extras/915c8b7bac2410695545cb94d0493b73.mp4?t=1738764390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
